{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/equestra-emaar-properties-grand-polo-club-and-resort","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1322,"crm_id":"3027","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Equestra","slug":"equestra-emaar-properties-grand-polo-club-and-resort","display_address":"Grand Polo Club and Resort","building_type":["townhouse"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":3700000,"display_price":"3.7M","lattitude":25.0227332,"longitude":55.2957332,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":"3,4","about":"<p>Equestra at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/grand-club-resort-emaar-properties/\">Grand Polo Club &amp; Resort</a> offers an elevated lifestyle shaped by Dubai’s equestrian legacy and Emaar’s architectural mastery.&nbsp;</p><p>This luxurious community features elegant 3- and 4-bedroom townhouses and super-luxury 5-bedroom residences set amidst serene green spaces and polo fields. With just a 10% down payment, residents can secure a refined address defined by leisure, connectivity, and craftsmanship.</p><p>Equestra by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar Properties</a> reflects a seamless fusion of modern living and heritage aesthetics. Set within a master plan built around wellness and recreation, it offers access to world-class amenities, including a clubhouse, polo fields, community center, and fitness areas.&nbsp;</p><p>Designed for discerning homeowners and investors, it promises strong ROI potential and a lifestyle immersed in prestige.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_7a9bcad730.jpg","hash":"Feature_7a9bcad730","name":"Equestra Feature"},"banner_i